Z||000002||bHooper||11-03-2000||09:15 AM||||i haven't dealt with them in years (like 5 or 6).  however, in the past they were very good about shipping things.<P>but that was a long time ago, and things do change.<P>i have [/b]never[/b] liked the fact that you cant access their website for parts, unless you are a member!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT||||reg||1
