Z||000029||Fiero5||11-05-2000||08:58 PM||||I am going to call them one more time on Monday. I will post how this latest attempt to get my order goes as soon as I get off the phone.<BR>Stay tuned.<BR><P>------------------<BR>                                                                                                                               <IMG SRC="http://freepages.ugo.com/RodeysPlace/files/fieroanim.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000030||fieroshop||11-07-2000||12:41 AM||||Well guys, I see that you are all getting hiped about nothing and everything. I talked to Gloria about four days ago and she was on her way to the hospital to be with Phil who is sitting vigil with his mother who had a massive heart attack and the docs. don't think she will make it. It took me four days of trying but Gloria and Phil have always come thru for me. <BR>Sometime being nice gets you more then being nasty.<BR>I personally think that if you nothing good to say about somebody,don't say anything at all.<BR>I don't like to put people down, especially if I don't know what is happening or what the current situation is.<BR>Grow up guys.<P>------------------<BR> <BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshop_sig_1.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by fieroshop (edited 11-07-2000).]||||reg||1
